# Operational notes — release walkthroughs with account-specific
# identifiers, kept locally so the public repo doesn't leak email,
# private-repo names, or other reconnaissance-friendly details.
# Synology Drive on this machine handles the off-machine backup of
# these files since the project tree is inside the synced folder.
ops/

# Android release signing — keystore + credentials MUST NEVER be committed.
# Losing them means you cannot publish updates to the existing Play app.
# Back them up to a password manager + an offline secure location.
android/keystore.properties
android/*.keystore
android/*.jks
android/app/*.keystore
android/app/*.jks
